---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About | Jevon Lipsey" description="About Jevon Lipsey, Ph.D. student at Colorado School of Mines MIRRORLab.">
  <div class="space-y-8">
    <div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground mb-2">About</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-zinc-400">
        Background, research context, and curriculum vitae.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        I am a Computer Science Ph.D. student at Colorado School of Mines in the <strong class="text-white font-medium">MIRROЯLab</strong>, advised by <strong class="text-white font-medium">Dr. Tom Williams</strong>.
      </p>

      <p>
        My research centers on <strong class="text-white font-medium">Human-Robot Interaction (HRI)</strong> to design equitable, community-grounded social robotic systems. I am motivated by how robots interface with marginalized communities—specifically exploring unhoused populations—and how we can formulate interactive protocols that respect privacy, preserve human dignity, and avoid paternalistic defaults.
      </p>

      <p>
        Prior to Mines, I completed my B.A. in Computer Science at <strong class="text-white font-medium">Colorado College</strong> (GPA 3.92, Steven Janke Award for Outstanding Achievement in CS, Euclid Scholar). My undergraduate research spanned neurosymbolic AI (published at AAAI-25 and PMLR 2025), computational redistricting using MCMC Markov chains, and cultural humanities research for Oxford University Press examining Midwestern Hip Hop subcultures and intersectional feminist frameworks.
      </p>

      <div class="pt-4 border-t border-border/40 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-sm font-mono">
        <a
          href="/cv.pdf"
          target="_blank"
          class="text-zinc-200 hover:text-white underline underline-offset-4 decoration-zinc-700 hover:decoration-zinc-300 transition-colors"
        >
          Curriculum Vitae (PDF) &nearr;
        </a>
        <span class="text-zinc-600">&bull;</span>
        <a
          href="/lipsey-resume.pdf"
          target="_blank"
          class="text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition-colors"
        >
          Resume (PDF) &nearr;
        </a>
        <span class="text-zinc-600">&bull;</span>
        <a
          href="mailto:jevon_lipsey@mines.edu"
          class="text-zinc-400 hover:text-white transition-colors"
        >
          jevon_lipsey@mines.edu
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
